{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19361","headline":"馆娃宫在旧郡西南砚石山前瞰姑苏台傍有采香径梁天监中置佛寺曰灵岩即故宫也信爲绝境因赋二章 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"馆娃宫在旧郡西南砚石山前瞰姑苏台傍有采香径梁天监中置佛寺曰灵岩即故宫也信爲绝境因赋二章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月殿移椒壁，天花代舜华。\n唯余采香径，一带绕山斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}